   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Date: 15-Sept-2009&#xA;&#xA;Originator: Sqn Ldr Henry&#xA;&#xA;RAF Andover says farewell to Andover with a parade throught the High Street in Andover and flybys from RAF Aircraft. RAF Andover has been handed over to Land now which will be there HQ. Events were held throughout the day on the High Street.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
