     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Image Â©Licensed to i-Images Picture Agency. 08/11/2019. London, United Kingdom. Boris Johnson General Election Campaign Day Three. Britain's Prime Minister Boris Johnson visits Iceland Foods HQ, Deeside,  on day three of his 2019 General Election Campaign. Picture by Andrew Parsons / i-Images</rdf:li>
