   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Prime Minister Boris Johnson meeting police officers during a visit to Whaley Bridge Football Club in Derbyshire, after the Toddbrook Reservoir near the village of Whaley Bridge was damaged in heavy rainfall.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
